{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都での個別握手会、来て下さりありがとうございました!\n昨日は、京都らしく浴衣を着たよ٩( 'ω' )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三つ編み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6P113PHCN6EES40RM6YT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">和っぽい柄ですよね🍁"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6Q1YMKMYQNM25AAPXJCE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nおだんごヘア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6R3CQCDV4TKK2MZK63DR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n久しぶりにしたなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6S2FZZNHJE7DZ46GHKE1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n今回は、大人っぽい柄の浴衣でした。\n次の握手会でも浴衣を着る予定なのでお楽しみに✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部、2部は夏服。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6T0YPHMKKD107J088Q4Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n髪を巻いたよ!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6V1HBBX9YNQ6ZY2XWB4A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部🍨"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6W01WGNJMFETQ7ZC9J91","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nドットのワンピース"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6X0KY8RCPWMVA26W2HYW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n初めてハーフアップにしたよ\nさくらんぼが付いてたの気づいたかな🍒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP6Y43J5K405FWRTJPMGRQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n見えずらかったけど、お気に入りポイントでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}